 {"q": "Which statement best describes the relation between Christian anti-Judaism and the Holocaust?", "options": ["The Holocaust was a Christian project carried out by the churches", "There is no connection at all, because Nazism was racial", "Nazism was racial and anti-Christian, but centuries of Christian contempt, and Church laws that Nazi laws echoed, prepared the ground and help explain the silence", "Christians were the main victims of the Holocaust"], "answer": 2, "why": "This is close to the judgement of Dabru Emet and of most historians, including Hilberg's table."},
